# Fragile ordering (Yesterday operator, epsilon-sensitive)
#
# Two VC-concurrent events at the end of the trace:
#   late_beacon (Drone2, t=T) and early_beacon (Drone1, t=T+delta)
#
# SAT when eps >= delta: concurrent, can order early_beacon first
# VIOL when eps < delta: time forces late_beacon first
late_beacon -> @early_beacon
